The '''Stone Frog''' is a decorative piece of [[furniture]] that can be purchased on [[Winter]] 15 from the [[Night Market#Magic Shop Boat|Magic Shop Boat]] at the [[Night Market]] for {{Price|500}}.  It may be placed anywhere in Stardew Valley, indoors or out.

==History==
{{History|1.3.27|Introduced.}}
